Package: simactivityservice
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Simulation Activity Service
 The Simulation Activity Service (SAS) provides simulation experiment
 time coordination using Google Protocol Buffers defined activity
 messages exchanged via ZeroMQ PUB/SUB.

Package: simactivityservice-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Headers necessary to interface with the Simulation Activity Service
 Topic definitions, protocol buffer message definitions and pkg-config
 file for applications that interface with the Simulation Activity
 Service.

Package: python3-simactivityservice
Architecture: all
Section: python
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3-protobuf,
         python3-zmq,
         python3-daemon
Description: Simulation Activity Service Python modules and utilities
 Python modules for interfacing with the Simulation Activity Service
 and the simactivityservice-surrogate-upstreamtime utility.
